   "subject": "請問散點圖(指令: qplot)能不能用迴圈繪製不同的變數呢",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "qplot 需先 library(ggplot2)<br><br>假設我的資料如下<br><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">str(TestData)\r\n</span>&#39;data.frame&#39;:\t96 obs. of   5 variables:\r\n $ Cate    : Ord.factor w/ 2 levels &quot;No&quot;&lt;&quot;Yes&quot;: 1 2 1 1 1 1 2 2 2 1 ...\r\n $ X       : num  449 772 595 280 702 516 477 605 750 460 ...\r\n $ Y1      : num  425 672 566 251 638 466 440 547 700 460 ...\r\n $ Y2      : num  407 624 544 203 596 438 381 507 665 444 ...\r\n $ Y3      : num  394 587 518 178 557 410 360 465 634 443 ...\r\n</pre></span></blockquote><br>我想要繪製散點圖各別是X~Y1, X~Y2, X~Y3<br>qplot(X,Y1,data=TestData,shape=cate1)<br>qplot(X,Y2,data=TestData,shape=cate1)<br>qplot(X,Y3,data=TestData,shape=cate1)<br><br>請問是否有迴圈方式達成以上要求呢？<br><br>我有試過用<br>for (i in c(TestData$Y1,TestData$Y2,TestData$Y3) )<br>的方式，沒有錯誤，但沒畫出圖來<br>後來檢查它是把變數Y1~Y3的數值帶入i<br><br>另外，我使用&quot;?&quot;符號要看for的說明文件時出現下面情況，沒有顯示說明文件<div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"> <br><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">?for\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">\r\n</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">+ </span></pre></span></blockquote><br>但使用 <span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"></span><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">help(&quot;for&quot;)</span><br><span style=\"color:blue\"></span></blockquote><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">就正常顯示出說明文件了</span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">我是使用RStudio V 0.97版</span><br><br></span><span style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">謝謝</span></span><br><span style=\"color:blue\"></span></pre></span></div>"
    ]
