   "date": "2013-02-18T04:30:49Z",
   "subject": "Re: 請問散點圖(指令: qplot)能不能用迴圈繪製不同的變數呢",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "你好，<div><br></div><div>請試試下面程式碼</div><div><br></div><div><div>library(ggplot2)</div><div>x &lt;- data.frame(matrix(rnorm(40),nrow=10));x</div><div><br></div><div>for (i in 2:4) {</div><div>  p &lt;- qplot(x[[1]],x[[i]],data=x,geom=&#39;point&#39;)</div><div>  print(p)</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>另</div><div><br></div><div>?&quot;for&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>可顯示說明文件，謝謝發問。</div></div>"
    ],
